qx|A1|st||rh||ah|Board 1 IMPs   -   January 10, 2024|pn|hondo717,danpsych,IraCT,toasterln|
md|3SKHT5DAT8742CQ742,ST4HAKJ43DQJ53C63,SQJ9863HQ72D96CAJ,SA752H986DKCKT985|sv|0|
mb|2S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I agree with 2@S opener. In general, I find no gap between 1@S and 2@S. So if you have a 6-card suit not strong enough to open one, there is no reason IMO where you should not open 2@S.|
PG| ***** 2 ***** |


mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
