mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I easily can bid 1@S. Some people call three aces ^*BAces and Spaces^*n derisively, but you should really like hands with aces. My hand is worth 13 HCP since aces are undervalued at 4 HCP each.|
PG| ***** 27 ***** |


mb|1S|mb|2D|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|D|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North has no clearcut call. I like double. The other choice is 3@D as limit raise, though I don't like to do that with only 3-card support.|
PG| ***** 28 ***** |


mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|2S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The problem now is I could have only five spades because I may have no other bid than 2@S even with only five.|
PG| ***** 29 ***** |


mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|3S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I think North chose the best auction.|
PG| ***** 30 ***** |


mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
