mb|3D|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I think 3@D is an overbid, but let's see how it works out. Admittedly, I do hate to pass with the West hand. That is what preempts do to the opponents.|
